 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Tamagawa-san Detemashita?"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "玉川さん出てました？"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The popular AV actress Miyama Yuri has suddenly announced her retirement.\n\nAt the same time, Shikishima, a convenience store manager and her biggest fan, finds himself at a loss—unsure of how to move forward without her in the industry.\n\nAmidst this, a girl named Tamagawa-san appears, applying for a job at Shikishima’s store. Coincidentally, she bears a striking resemblance to Miyama Yuri.\n\nThis uncanny similarity leaves Shikishima torn. Should he ask if Tamagawa-san was ever part of the AV industry? But in today’s politically sensitive climate, such a question feels risky…\n\nWho is Tamagawa-san really?"
  },
